      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Simple, easy to implement and will probably help a lot of people. I like it!\n\nI wonder if it should just be a part of snap turning, or if it should warrant it's own option. IMO, it should be native to snap turning, but mindful of not being triggered accidentally when the user means to only do one snap turn.",
