  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-21T01:00:52.431Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "i have wrist pain, and flicking the stick hundreds of times an hour makes it worse. \n\nit would be nice if holding the stick turned me repeatedly. turning at the same rate as non-comfort turning would be helpful.",
